WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:30.600 --> 00:31.440
Overseeing Line Two.

3
00:31.480 --> 00:32.159
Chief Engineer Chen!

4
00:32.560 --> 00:33.119
Chief Engineer Chen is here!

5
00:33.280 --> 00:33.840
He's here, he's here.

6
00:33.840 --> 00:34.320
I see him.

7
00:34.479 --> 00:35.119
Chief Engineer Chen is here!

8
00:35.640 --> 00:36.200
Chief Engineer Chen!

9
00:37.719 --> 00:38.479
He's here! Chief Engineer Chen's here!

10
00:38.600 --> 00:39.280
Here he comes, here he comes!

11
00:39.520 --> 00:40.000
Quick, quick, quick!

12
00:40.840 --> 00:41.359
Chunyan, Chunyan!

13
00:41.479 --> 00:42.240
Chief Engineer Chen is here!

14
00:42.520 --> 00:42.960
Hurry!

15
00:44.600 --> 00:45.079
Chief Engineer Chen!

16
00:45.399 --> 00:45.840
Chief Engineer Chen!

17
00:46.679 --> 00:47.200
You're all here!

18
00:48.000 --> 00:48.479
Have a seat, sit down.

19
00:48.520 --> 00:48.880
Here.

20
00:50.920 --> 00:51.359
Thanks.

21
00:51.520 --> 00:51.960
Stop cracking seeds.

22
00:52.359 --> 00:53.799
You even brought me a cup.

23
00:54.759 --> 00:55.320
Stop cracking seeds. Thanks.

24
00:55.399 --> 00:55.880
Chunyan!

25
00:56.200 --> 00:57.240
Let's hear Chief Engineer Chen say a few words.

26
00:59.880 --> 01:00.479
Well...

27
01:01.359 --> 01:02.000
Earlier,

28
01:03.960 --> 01:05.159
I went to Ma Guowen

29
01:05.400 --> 01:06.400
to sound him out...

30
01:12.599 --> 01:13.079
No, no, no.

31
01:13.079 --> 01:13.959
He's one of us, one of us.

32
01:14.599 --> 01:15.319
Keep on recording.

33
01:18.079 --> 01:19.280
I went to Ma Guowen

34
01:19.680 --> 01:20.319
and felt him out.

35
01:20.640 --> 01:21.599
Know your opponent, right?

36
01:21.719 --> 01:22.319
Right, right, right!

37
01:22.319 --> 01:22.840
Isn't that right?

38
01:23.239 --> 01:24.519
So don't worry, everyone.

39
01:25.239 --> 01:27.200
On the day of the auction,

40
01:27.760 --> 01:28.560
Qian Yichuan and I

41
01:29.200 --> 01:31.040
will represent us at the bidding.

42
01:31.359 --> 01:31.760
Sounds good.

43
01:31.799 --> 01:32.439
Good, good, good!

44
01:32.519 --> 01:32.840
Great!

45
01:32.840 --> 01:33.519
Great, wonderful!

46
01:36.200 --> 01:37.319
What I mean is,

47
01:38.040 --> 01:40.439
the spirit of daring to think and act

48
01:40.840 --> 01:42.400
is what Lacheng Brewery is all about!

49
01:42.560 --> 01:43.640
Exactly! That's right!

50
01:43.959 --> 01:44.560
Right, right, right!

51
01:44.599 --> 01:45.000
Isn't that so?

52
01:45.120 --> 01:46.120
Come on, come on!

53
01:46.120 --> 01:47.280
Let's give Chief Engineer Chen a big hand!

54
01:49.120 --> 01:49.959
All right, that's enough, that's enough.

55
01:50.079 --> 01:51.079
Have some melon seeds, come on.

56
01:51.280 --> 01:52.400
Have some seeds, eat up.

57
01:52.560 --> 01:53.239
Here, Chief Engineer Chen.

58
01:53.359 --> 01:54.239
Have some seeds, help yourself.

59
01:54.280 --> 01:55.159
Thank you, everyone. Give me a bit more.

60
01:55.159 --> 01:56.000
That's plenty, that's plenty!

61
01:56.359 --> 01:57.640
Don't just eat melon seeds.

62
01:57.680 --> 01:58.480
Drink some water.

63
01:58.599 --> 01:59.200
It dries out your mouth.

64
01:59.480 --> 02:00.040
Have some seeds, don't be shy.

65
02:00.040 --> 02:00.599
Have some seeds.

66
02:01.359 --> 02:02.159
Have some seeds, eat up.

67
02:02.319 --> 02:03.120
Have some seeds, have some seeds.

68
02:03.400 --> 02:03.840
Have some seeds.

69
02:05.079 --> 02:06.120
Why're you handing me empty shells?

70
02:07.079 --> 02:07.760
I'll get a sore throat!

71
02:08.919 --> 02:09.599
Eating too many gives you a sore throat.

72
03:45.719 --> 03:46.879
Where were you the day Cao Jun died?

73
03:47.199 --> 03:47.879
Cao Jun?

74
03:53.639 --> 03:54.800
I was at my son's place.

75
03:56.960 --> 03:58.000
Then I had a few drinks,

76
03:58.560 --> 03:59.240
and slept for a bit.

77
04:00.120 --> 04:01.759
Later, I drove home.

78
04:02.879 --> 04:04.759
But as I passed the factory gate,

79
04:06.120 --> 04:07.199
I hit that sculpture.

80
04:08.360 --> 04:09.919
Then... Then I went to...

81
04:11.319 --> 04:12.000
the traffic police.

82
04:12.360 --> 04:13.080
Got it all sorted out.

83
04:13.360 --> 04:13.680
Yeah.

84
04:15.039 --> 04:16.920
I've... I've still got the ticket right here.

85
04:18.199 --> 04:18.920
Take a look.

86
04:37.600 --> 04:37.959
Wu,

87
04:38.360 --> 04:39.480
stay with Engineer Chen.

88
04:39.920 --> 04:40.560
Got it. I'll go...

89
04:41.040 --> 04:41.959
verify the ticket.

90
04:43.000 --> 04:43.680
Hurry it up.

91
04:43.720 --> 04:44.720
I need to get home.

92
04:54.199 --> 04:55.800
Would you keep a ticket forever?

93
04:56.439 --> 04:57.399
Like a souvenir?

94
04:58.800 --> 04:59.759
Commemorating...

95
05:00.360 --> 05:01.079
getting fined?

96
05:02.279 --> 05:03.920
Carrying it in your wallet every day,

97
05:04.839 --> 05:05.920
ready to pull it out anytime,

98
05:06.800 --> 05:08.079
like he's just waiting for me to ask.

99
05:08.600 --> 05:11.360
A ticket isn't a bankbook!

100
05:18.519 --> 05:19.959
Why isn't he back yet?

101
05:22.360 --> 05:22.839
Officer,

102
05:23.399 --> 05:24.759
when can I leave?

103
05:29.199 --> 05:29.839
How about this?

104
05:30.399 --> 05:32.040
Go get your boss for me.

105
05:33.079 --> 05:34.519
I have things to deal with at home.

106
05:43.399 --> 05:44.519
Can I get some water?

107
05:45.040 --> 05:45.959
Cold or hot?

108
05:46.360 --> 05:47.199
I'll pour some for you.

109
05:47.879 --> 05:48.680
Oh, so you can talk?

110
05:49.040 --> 05:49.720
Warm.

111
05:53.680 --> 05:54.319
Chief Engineer Chen,

112
05:55.040 --> 05:56.040
we checked everything out.

113
05:56.199 --> 05:57.120
Thanks for your cooperation.

114
05:57.759 --> 05:59.199
The paperwork is all clear.

115
05:59.279 --> 05:59.959
It's sorted out?

116
06:01.800 --> 06:02.720
Can I leave now?

117
06:04.560 --> 06:05.680
Just a moment longer.

118
06:05.879 --> 06:08.519
Didn't you say you hit that sculpture?

119
06:09.680 --> 06:10.959
Right now, I need you to...

120
06:10.959 --> 06:12.879
walk me through the details.

121
06:13.160 --> 06:14.079
How did you hit it?

122
06:14.079 --> 06:15.120
Why did you hit it?

123
06:15.160 --> 06:16.000
What time did it happen?

124
06:16.199 --> 06:18.000
Haven't you looked into that already?

125
06:18.279 --> 06:21.040
Traffic police already settled this.

126
06:22.240 --> 06:22.720
Why are you people...

127
06:22.720 --> 06:23.720
When did you crash?

128
06:24.040 --> 06:24.720
What time?

129
06:29.560 --> 06:30.319
The middle of the night.

130
06:31.399 --> 06:32.560
Around 2:00 a.m.

131
06:32.839 --> 06:34.720
Out joyriding at 2:00 a.m.?

132
06:35.480 --> 06:36.600
Didn't I tell you?

133
06:37.079 --> 06:38.439
I was at my son's place.

134
06:38.920 --> 06:42.160
I was heading home from there to sleep.

135
06:42.600 --> 06:43.199
Then...

136
06:43.519 --> 06:44.800
with such a huge sculpture,

137
06:45.079 --> 06:46.040
how did you manage to hit it?

138
06:46.040 --> 06:47.040
Couldn't you see it?

139
06:47.279 --> 06:48.879
A truck was coming toward me.

140
06:49.240 --> 06:49.959
High beams blazing.

141
06:49.959 --> 06:51.920
Blinded me completely!

142
06:52.120 --> 06:53.319
So I swerved the wheel,

143
06:53.360 --> 06:53.839
BAM!

144
06:53.959 --> 06:54.600
Crashed right into it.

145
06:54.839 --> 06:55.560
Blinded you, huh?

146
06:55.759 --> 06:57.720
Did you turn this way at the west junction,

147
06:57.720 --> 06:58.680
or at the east junction

148
06:58.720 --> 06:59.399
when you turned that way and crashed?

149
06:59.399 --> 06:59.800
The east one.

150
07:00.600 --> 07:01.759
Go check it yourself!

151
07:02.680 --> 07:03.759
You're picking on me on purpose!

152
07:03.759 --> 07:04.480
Let me tell you,

153
07:10.439 --> 07:11.480
when are you letting me go?

154
07:12.680 --> 07:13.160
If not,

155
07:13.199 --> 07:14.240
get your boss in here!

156
07:14.639 --> 07:16.160
I'm just waiting for you to remember.

157
07:16.319 --> 07:17.240
About the steering wheel...

158
07:17.680 --> 07:19.279
You remember taking a leak back in '99,

159
07:19.319 --> 07:20.600
but you forgot how you crashed?

160
07:23.519 --> 07:24.279
I get it now.

161
07:25.040 --> 07:26.040
That fat guy...

162
07:26.480 --> 07:27.480
you put him up to this, didn't you?

163
07:28.480 --> 07:29.360
Set a trap for me,

164
07:29.399 --> 07:30.560
brought me here,

165
07:30.759 --> 07:32.040
and now you're grilling me.

166
07:35.839 --> 07:36.360
I'm leaving!

167
07:37.519 --> 07:38.079
Please, sit down.

168
07:39.199 --> 07:39.800
We're not done talking yet.

169
07:40.399 --> 07:40.959
Sit down!

170
07:57.480 --> 07:58.879
Did you hit that sculpture?

171
08:07.759 --> 08:09.160
You actually believe Chen Qingchun?

172
08:10.199 --> 08:11.120
I don't!

173
08:11.839 --> 08:13.279
The guy's got an alibi.

174
08:13.519 --> 08:15.839
Even if he claimed he hit it sleepwalking,

175
08:15.839 --> 08:16.439
you'd still have to believe him.

176
08:16.879 --> 08:17.519
If you want to question him,

177
08:17.519 --> 08:18.240
you need evidence.

178
08:19.920 --> 08:22.519
Didn't you find any surveillance,

179
08:23.120 --> 08:24.240
any fingerprints,

180
08:24.720 --> 08:26.319
or any leads like that?

181
08:27.879 --> 08:29.399
If I had even one of those,

182
08:29.839 --> 08:30.600
I wouldn't be here.

183
08:33.399 --> 08:34.200
How long has he been locked up?

184
08:36.720 --> 08:37.960
Five or six hours.

185
08:39.039 --> 08:39.960
Alright, stop taking photos.

186
08:46.440 --> 08:47.000
Cai,

187
08:47.440 --> 08:48.399
hurry up right now

188
08:48.399 --> 08:49.639
and check all the repair shops

189
08:49.720 --> 08:50.759
across Lacheng

190
08:50.759 --> 08:52.639
for records from the past two weeks.

191
08:52.759 --> 08:54.200
Report back to me when you're done.

192
08:57.080 --> 08:57.679
You,

193
08:57.919 --> 08:58.600
head to traffic police.

194
09:03.720 --> 09:04.279
Go on!

195
09:04.279 --> 09:05.120
What are you staring at me for?

196
09:05.320 --> 09:05.879
Where are you going?

197
09:06.759 --> 09:08.000
Mind your own business.

198
09:08.519 --> 09:09.639
Then what am I going there for?

199
09:10.159 --> 09:11.120
Do what you're supposed to do.

200
09:11.120 --> 09:12.080
Do what, exactly?

201
09:12.840 --> 09:14.639
You do whatever I tell you to do!

202
09:16.440 --> 09:17.559
What're you getting worked up for?

203
09:19.639 --> 09:20.399
Bring it back to me.

204
09:20.879 --> 09:21.919
What are you doing?

205
09:23.080 --> 09:24.279
Fine, I'll do whatever you say.

206
09:28.240 --> 09:29.159
Someone crashed into the sculpture.

207
09:29.600 --> 09:30.480
It was hit right here.

208
09:30.480 --> 09:30.919
Look.

209
09:30.919 --> 09:31.679
Take a look here.

210
09:32.159 --> 09:32.679
Who hit it?

211
09:33.799 --> 09:35.279
Our factory's former chief engineer.

212
09:35.399 --> 09:36.559
Name's Chen Qingchun.

213
09:49.759 --> 09:50.399
Brother Chuang,

214
09:51.240 --> 09:52.440
this is Chen Qingchun's car.

215
10:46.600 --> 10:47.000
Gao,

216
10:47.399 --> 10:48.559
did you get to traffic police yet?

217
10:49.799 --> 10:51.720
I'm by the sculpture outside Lacheng Brewery.

218
10:52.639 --> 10:53.720
I found a lead.

219
10:55.960 --> 10:57.720
I picked up a piece of car debris.

220
10:58.759 --> 11:00.159
But it's silver.

221
11:00.799 --> 11:02.600
Chen Qingchun's car is black, right?

222
11:05.440 --> 11:06.879
Besides, looking at

223
11:07.200 --> 11:08.279
where it hit,

224
11:09.559 --> 11:11.960
it doesn't look like a sedan could reach that high.

225
11:12.480 --> 11:13.120
Two weeks ago,

226
11:13.320 --> 11:15.039
the sculpture outside Lacheng Brewery's main gate

227
11:15.159 --> 11:16.080
was struck by a vehicle.

228
11:16.559 --> 11:17.559
Currently, our city is in

229
11:17.559 --> 11:18.759
a critical period of

230
11:18.759 --> 11:19.399
our Civilized City campaign.

231
11:19.919 --> 11:21.399
This incident has had an egregious impact.

232
11:21.840 --> 11:23.159
If the perpetrator turns themselves in

233
11:23.159 --> 11:25.039
to the Lacheng Traffic Police Brigade today

234
11:25.039 --> 11:25.679
and admits responsibility,

235
11:25.840 --> 11:26.960
leniency may be granted.

236
11:27.399 --> 11:28.559
Any citizen who comes forward with information

237
11:28.559 --> 11:29.759
will also be rewarded accordingly.

238
11:54.960 --> 11:55.600
Hello? What's up?

239
11:56.960 --> 11:57.720
Ermao?

240
11:59.440 --> 12:00.080
I... I...

241
12:00.600 --> 12:01.279
I... I...

242
12:01.279 --> 12:02.159
I wanted to ask...

243
12:02.279 --> 12:04.000
Isn't Engineer Chen playing cards with you guys?

244
12:05.080 --> 12:05.559
Nope.

245
12:05.759 --> 12:06.240
He didn't come.

246
12:06.240 --> 12:06.799
He didn't?

247
12:07.559 --> 12:07.919
Well...

248
12:08.279 --> 12:10.360
Doesn't he join you guys every day?

249
12:10.879 --> 12:11.879
Well, he didn't come today.

250
12:13.960 --> 12:15.320
I tried calling him...

251
12:15.519 --> 12:16.480
and he didn't pick up.

252
12:17.720 --> 12:18.840
I've been calling him all day too.

253
12:19.080 --> 12:19.679
Can't reach him anywhere.

254
12:20.679 --> 12:21.080
Really.

255
12:22.879 --> 12:24.360
Well... you guys carry on then.

256
12:54.960 --> 12:55.480
Tieping,

257
12:56.720 --> 12:57.600
come home at noon.

258
12:59.240 --> 13:00.039
I have something urgent.

259
13:01.240 --> 13:02.000
Need to go to the traffic police.

260
13:04.840 --> 13:05.279
I just...

261
13:05.399 --> 13:06.720
My mind went completely blank.

262
13:07.120 --> 13:07.799
I looked up,

263
13:07.879 --> 13:09.080
and that dark sculpture

264
13:09.080 --> 13:09.799
was right in front of me!

265
13:10.120 --> 13:12.000
I yanked the wheel as hard as I could,

266
13:12.200 --> 13:13.200
yanked, and then—crash!

267
13:14.120 --> 13:14.639
Alright.

268
13:14.919 --> 13:15.360
In short,

269
13:15.360 --> 13:16.279
you crashed into it, right?

270
13:17.000 --> 13:17.720
Yes, yes, yes.

271
13:18.440 --> 13:19.519
I really did hit it.

272
13:20.519 --> 13:21.320
Officer,

273
13:23.000 --> 13:24.200
I'll take whatever punishment.

274
13:24.559 --> 13:24.960
I accept it.

275
13:25.000 --> 13:25.440
Sir,

276
13:27.120 --> 13:27.919
you...

277
13:27.960 --> 13:29.279
Why weren't you asleep in the middle of the night?

278
13:29.759 --> 13:31.000
What were you running off to the factory for?

279
13:32.919 --> 13:34.360
Isn't the factory about to be sold?

280
13:35.320 --> 13:36.120
Well,

281
13:36.320 --> 13:37.720
I made plans with a few old buddies

282
13:38.159 --> 13:39.720
to go back to the factory and chat with them.

283
13:41.559 --> 13:42.279
You'd been drinking, hadn't you?

284
13:42.879 --> 13:43.679
No, I hadn't.

285
13:47.000 --> 13:48.080
Why don't you believe me?

286
13:50.559 --> 13:51.759
Ever since leaving the factory,

287
13:52.120 --> 13:52.879
I haven't had a drop.

288
13:53.759 --> 13:54.720
If you weren't drinking,

289
13:54.720 --> 13:55.639
why did you run?

290
13:56.240 --> 13:57.240
Instead of reporting it to traffic police,

291
13:57.240 --> 13:58.360
you... you just took off?

292
13:59.639 --> 14:01.279
I didn't think that much.

293
14:01.399 --> 14:02.279
I just figured,

294
14:03.080 --> 14:03.559
wasn't it...

295
14:04.440 --> 14:05.440
nobody got hurt,

296
14:05.639 --> 14:06.639
wasn't it just a sculpture?

297
14:07.080 --> 14:08.240
The factory is being sold anyway.

298
14:08.879 --> 14:10.000
I'd just spend some money,

299
14:10.279 --> 14:11.879
get the car fixed up myself,

300
14:13.039 --> 14:13.919
and chalk it up to bad luck.

301
14:15.960 --> 14:17.559
Then the mechanic told me,

302
14:17.799 --> 14:20.039
he said it counts as property damage,

303
14:20.720 --> 14:22.480
and it's considered a hit-and-run.

304
14:23.240 --> 14:24.159
So I thought about it,

305
14:24.159 --> 14:24.840
this... this...

306
14:24.919 --> 14:25.879
wouldn't I be screwed?

307
14:26.120 --> 14:27.399
So I rushed right over.

308
14:29.000 --> 14:30.919
The traffic officers told me

309
14:31.399 --> 14:33.159
that Chen Qingchun took the blame

310
14:33.639 --> 14:34.559
and already paid the fine.

311
14:35.799 --> 14:36.759
I figured

312
14:37.440 --> 14:38.240
that would be the end of it.

313
14:38.519 --> 14:40.200
Didn't expect to hear the broadcast today,

314
14:40.320 --> 14:41.519
only to realize it isn't over.

315
14:41.720 --> 14:43.399
Why would Chen Qingchun falsely confess?

316
14:43.759 --> 14:44.559
Didn't you ask him?

317
14:48.519 --> 14:49.639
It wasn't easy

318
14:50.720 --> 14:52.279
getting everyone together,

319
14:53.320 --> 14:55.120
and Qian Yichuan went and ruined it all.

320
15:01.399 --> 15:02.080
Chief Engineer Chen,

321
15:03.159 --> 15:03.919
there's one more thing.

322
15:11.440 --> 15:12.000
What's this?

323
15:12.200 --> 15:12.840
For me?

324
15:13.840 --> 15:14.639
A leg of lamb.

325
15:15.440 --> 15:16.080
Take it.

326
15:17.519 --> 15:18.320
What's this for?

327
15:19.080 --> 15:20.519
You did me a huge favor.

328
15:21.519 --> 15:22.559
You really came through for me.

329
15:23.200 --> 15:23.720
I...

330
15:26.759 --> 15:27.919
About hitting that sculpture.

331
15:28.720 --> 15:29.960
The one by the factory gate.

332
15:36.039 --> 15:36.759
Look,

333
15:37.519 --> 15:38.279
my lips are sealed.

334
15:38.720 --> 15:39.919
I didn't tell a soul.

335
15:40.320 --> 15:40.759
No, wait.

336
15:42.000 --> 15:43.120
Why did you go

337
15:44.080 --> 15:46.120
to the traffic police and take the fall for me?

338
15:46.679 --> 15:47.639
If it wasn't sorted out cleanly,

339
15:47.639 --> 15:49.000
I wouldn't have peace of mind.

340
15:51.639 --> 15:54.200
I went to Chen Yuan's place that day.

341
15:54.919 --> 15:56.840
The two of us had a few drinks.

342
15:57.720 --> 15:59.320
Then I got a bit sleepy.

343
16:00.519 --> 16:01.840
He told me not to go back,

344
16:01.960 --> 16:03.039
just sleep over at his place.

345
16:04.000 --> 16:04.879
But then,

346
16:04.919 --> 16:06.240
I woke up in the middle of the night.

347
16:07.720 --> 16:08.799
And I just wanted to go home.

348
16:09.600 --> 16:12.320
At the time, I felt like I was pretty...

349
16:12.559 --> 16:13.639
pretty sober.

350
16:14.840 --> 16:17.240
I figured there'd be no one on the road so late.

351
16:17.679 --> 16:20.320
Besides, it had been a long time since I drank.

352
16:20.879 --> 16:22.240
So I drove back.

353
16:23.200 --> 16:24.960
When I passed by the brewery,

354
16:26.320 --> 16:28.000
a big truck came from the other way.

355
16:28.360 --> 16:30.320
That bastard had his high beams on,

356
16:30.399 --> 16:32.120
blinding me so I couldn't see a thing.

357
16:32.159 --> 16:33.279
In a moment of panic,

358
16:33.559 --> 16:35.039
I must have jerked the steering wheel.

359
16:35.200 --> 16:35.840
*Bam!*

360
16:36.639 --> 16:37.600
Smashed right into that sculpture.

361
16:37.879 --> 16:38.840
Holy crap!

362
16:39.480 --> 16:41.000
The exact same thing happened to us!

363
16:41.600 --> 16:42.320
Me too!

364
16:42.480 --> 16:43.639
Ran into a bastard

365
16:44.080 --> 16:44.759
with high beams on.

366
16:45.000 --> 16:45.679
Blinded me so bad...

367
16:45.720 --> 16:46.159
I went *bam!*

368
16:47.519 --> 16:48.600
Hit twice in one night!

369
16:49.759 --> 16:51.759
You must have crashed right where I hit it!

370
16:51.799 --> 16:52.759
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

371
16:52.960 --> 16:54.360
But I couldn't tell at all.

372
16:54.519 --> 16:56.039
Just slammed right into it!

373
16:56.440 --> 16:57.360
You weren't hurt, right?

374
16:57.519 --> 16:57.879
I'm fine, I'm fine.

375
16:57.919 --> 16:58.600
Look at that.

376
16:59.799 --> 17:00.600
How much was the fine?

377
17:01.879 --> 17:02.240
Forget it.

378
17:02.919 --> 17:03.879
It's all in the past now.

379
17:03.960 --> 17:04.680
Don't worry about it.

380
17:04.720 --> 17:05.240
That won't do.

381
17:05.279 --> 17:06.279
I... I've already taken care of it.

382
17:06.359 --> 17:06.880
No, no way.

383
17:06.960 --> 17:08.119
Can't let you handle it alone.

384
17:08.839 --> 17:09.400
It's fine, really.

385
17:09.680 --> 17:10.240
Take the leg of lamb.

386
17:10.839 --> 17:11.200
No, don't, don't.

387
17:11.200 --> 17:11.519
Keep it.

388
17:11.920 --> 17:12.240
I've got plenty.

389
17:12.599 --> 17:13.319
Come on, now.

390
17:13.680 --> 17:15.119
You run a restaurant here,

391
17:16.119 --> 17:17.079
with lots of customers.

392
17:17.119 --> 17:17.640
You keep it.

393
17:17.720 --> 17:18.359
No, really, don't.

394
17:19.799 --> 17:20.359
Don't be polite.

395
17:20.400 --> 17:21.119
No, I really can't.

396
17:29.559 --> 17:30.480
Bro, you can sit over there in a bit.

397
17:33.119 --> 17:33.759
With my legs,

398
17:33.799 --> 17:34.880
standing feels better.

399
17:43.359 --> 17:45.200
What right do you have to bring me here?

400
17:46.119 --> 17:47.839
Would we bring you here for no reason?

401
17:49.200 --> 17:50.680
Xiao Wu, shut the door.

402
17:51.440 --> 17:52.000
Take a seat.

403
17:52.839 --> 17:53.640
Cooperate with our investigation.

404
18:06.759 --> 18:07.400
Chief Engineer Chen,

405
18:08.160 --> 18:08.960
you're quite something.

406
18:10.920 --> 18:12.240
Traffic police inspected the scene.

407
18:12.319 --> 18:13.200
They said that sculpture

408
18:13.200 --> 18:14.599
was hit by a minivan

409
18:14.599 --> 18:16.400
going over sixty kilometers an hour.

410
18:16.400 --> 18:18.279
I remember you drive a Santana.

411
18:19.039 --> 18:19.720
It went flying.

412
18:20.960 --> 18:22.319
And the repair shop said

413
18:22.319 --> 18:23.759
all you replaced was a bumper.

414
18:24.519 --> 18:25.680
Pretty solid car, huh?

415
18:26.319 --> 18:27.720
Over sixty kilometers an hour,

416
18:27.720 --> 18:29.039
and just a bumper replaced.

417
18:31.599 --> 18:32.519
Cheng Youtian already confessed.

418
18:32.839 --> 18:33.400
He's the one who hit it.

419
18:35.160 --> 18:36.640
Now you're the one lying to us.

420
18:37.279 --> 18:38.799
The real issue here is,

421
18:39.119 --> 18:41.440
the day the sculpture was hit and Cao Jun's death

422
18:41.440 --> 18:42.480
happened at the exact same time.

423
18:43.359 --> 18:45.119
Why choose this exact moment

424
18:45.200 --> 18:46.640
to take the fall?

425
18:47.279 --> 18:49.000
Taking the blame for a minor offense

426
18:49.000 --> 18:49.680
to cover up a major crime,

427
18:49.759 --> 18:50.200
aren't you?

428
18:50.920 --> 18:52.559
Setting yourself up with an alibi.

429
18:53.079 --> 18:54.079
Pretty calculating of you.

430
19:01.400 --> 19:02.200
Know what this is?

431
19:02.519 --> 19:03.440
Didn't you know

432
19:03.440 --> 19:04.880
Cao Jun kept a diary?

433
19:06.599 --> 19:08.599
He wrote in this diary

434
19:08.599 --> 19:10.680
that he found the traitor who betrayed the workers.

435
19:11.440 --> 19:12.480
That traitor is you, isn't it?

436
19:14.599 --> 19:15.359
Let me tell you something.

437
19:16.319 --> 19:17.359
We've moved to a different room,

438
19:17.559 --> 19:18.759
and things have taken a serious turn.

439
19:19.319 --> 19:20.759
You can keep glaring at me

440
19:20.799 --> 19:21.759
and making a scene like before.

441
19:21.839 --> 19:23.039
But I hope you realize

442
19:23.240 --> 19:24.519
I'm giving you a chance here.

443
19:26.640 --> 19:27.440
Think it through

444
19:28.480 --> 19:29.160
before you open your mouth.

445
19:37.599 --> 19:38.839
I'm the traitor.

446
19:47.319 --> 19:48.119
I was the one...

447
19:50.359 --> 19:51.279
who killed Cao Jun.

448
19:53.960 --> 19:58.160
It all started back in '99 when the plant was sold.

449
20:09.680 --> 20:10.279
What is it?

450
20:10.720 --> 20:11.960
Hesitating now?

451
20:12.680 --> 20:14.839
Did you forget you joined their bunch

452
20:15.240 --> 20:16.960
only after we talked it over?

453
20:17.519 --> 20:19.200
What now, did they turn you?

454
20:19.240 --> 20:20.519
Getting cold feet?

455
20:20.680 --> 20:21.599
No.

456
20:21.720 --> 20:22.720
Lately...

457
20:22.759 --> 20:23.519
everyone

458
20:24.319 --> 20:25.720
is worried about being laid off,

459
20:26.960 --> 20:28.200
scared of losing their livelihoods.

460
20:30.200 --> 20:30.640
Old Chen,

461
20:30.640 --> 20:31.599
there are no outsiders here.

462
20:31.640 --> 20:32.920
Stop beating around the bush.

463
20:33.000 --> 20:34.000
Hurry up and let me see it.

464
20:34.119 --> 20:35.000
Let's see what they're scheming.

465
20:36.240 --> 20:36.720
Well...

466
20:38.400 --> 20:39.599
If we win the bid this time

467
20:39.599 --> 20:40.359
and I become director,

468
20:40.519 --> 20:41.279
I'm number one,

469
20:41.319 --> 20:42.480
and you're number two.

470
20:42.640 --> 20:43.279
Aside from me,

471
20:43.480 --> 20:44.720
you'll be the top boss in our plant.

472
20:44.920 --> 20:45.480
You get it?

473
20:45.960 --> 20:47.359
Well, over on their side,

474
20:47.759 --> 20:49.359
I'm at least number two as well.

475
20:49.880 --> 20:50.720
Besides,

476
20:51.519 --> 20:52.519
I'm a major shareholder.

477
20:55.319 --> 20:56.920
Did you

478
20:57.160 --> 20:58.000
put up any cash over there?

479
21:00.480 --> 21:01.839
You always have to invest some cash, right?

480
21:05.480 --> 21:06.039
Tell you what.

481
21:06.680 --> 21:07.359
When I become director,

482
21:08.279 --> 21:10.119
you won't pay a single cent with me,

483
21:10.960 --> 21:12.599
and I'll double the shares they gave you.

484
21:13.160 --> 21:13.799
Deal?

485
21:15.440 --> 21:15.920
What's more,

486
21:16.559 --> 21:17.559
once I'm director,

487
21:18.160 --> 21:19.079
I'll send people...

488
21:19.599 --> 21:21.160
send you abroad

489
21:21.319 --> 21:22.079
on an inspection tour.

490
21:22.319 --> 21:23.400
We'll bring in some new machinery

491
21:23.519 --> 21:24.839
and boost our production.

492
21:25.279 --> 21:26.359
Everything on the tech side,

493
21:26.440 --> 21:27.079
you'll have the final say.

494
21:27.240 --> 21:27.880
You'll call the shots.

495
21:28.160 --> 21:28.680
Sound good?

496
21:29.759 --> 21:30.279
Really?

497
21:30.920 --> 21:31.480
Absolutely.

498
21:31.680 --> 21:32.640
When I, Ma Guowen, give my word,

499
21:33.000 --> 21:34.319
a promise is a promise,

500
21:34.319 --> 21:34.880
and it's carved in stone.

501
21:40.200 --> 21:40.880
Director Ma,

502
21:41.559 --> 21:43.119
you're basically setting me up

503
21:43.799 --> 21:44.960
to look heartless and disloyal, huh?

504
21:45.200 --> 21:45.519
Well...

505
21:45.640 --> 21:45.960
You...

506
21:46.759 --> 21:47.519
You know,

507
21:47.759 --> 21:48.759
the way you educated folks talk,

508
21:48.799 --> 21:50.240
it really gets on my nerves.

509
21:51.359 --> 21:52.480
Auction organizer,

510
21:52.720 --> 21:53.480
bidders,

511
21:53.559 --> 21:55.119
reserve price setting...

512
21:55.599 --> 21:57.240
This is put together in real detail.

513
21:57.279 --> 21:58.240
Pretty comprehensive, too.

514
21:58.759 --> 22:00.079
You came well prepared, huh?

515
22:04.519 --> 22:05.000
Old Chen.

516
22:05.400 --> 22:06.599
The man I know...

517
22:06.960 --> 22:08.079
can not only help you,

518
22:08.240 --> 22:09.359
but can help your son too.

519
22:09.920 --> 22:10.640
Who?

520
22:12.480 --> 22:13.559
I'll take you to meet him in a bit.

521
22:13.640 --> 22:14.319
No, don't wait.

522
22:14.359 --> 22:15.039
Let's go right now.

523
22:15.119 --> 22:15.559
Let's go.

524
22:16.039 --> 22:17.000
That guy has serious clout.

525
22:21.240 --> 22:22.119
Are you serious?

526
22:22.720 --> 22:23.559
Guowen, please, come on in.

527
22:23.559 --> 22:23.920
Old Chen.

528
22:23.960 --> 22:24.359
Come in, come in.

529
22:24.359 --> 22:24.880
Please, come in.

530
22:24.880 --> 22:25.400
Come on in.

531
22:27.079 --> 22:27.680
I say, Guowen...

532
22:27.680 --> 22:28.359
look at you.

533
22:28.440 --> 22:29.759
Why did you bring gifts?

534
22:29.839 --> 22:30.680
It's the least I could do.

535
22:31.039 --> 22:31.839
Let me introduce you.

536
22:31.839 --> 22:33.440
Our brewery's Chief Engineer, Chen Qingchun.

537
22:34.079 --> 22:35.039
And I don't need to introduce this man, right?

538
22:35.079 --> 22:36.319
In the prime of his life at the ICB,

539
22:36.319 --> 22:38.279
the renowned Director of the ICB, Zheng Aimin.

540
22:38.880 --> 22:39.319
Director Zheng.

541
22:39.680 --> 22:40.240
Hello, hello.

542
22:40.279 --> 22:41.079
Hello, hello, hello.

543
22:41.160 --> 22:41.599
Hello.

544
22:41.759 --> 22:42.240
Chief Chen.

545
22:42.440 --> 22:42.839
Good, good, good.

546
22:42.880 --> 22:43.240
Come, come.

547
22:43.240 --> 22:43.559
Sit down, please sit.

548
22:43.599 --> 22:44.160
Make yourselves at home.

549
22:48.039 --> 22:48.400
Old Chen.

550
22:48.960 --> 22:49.839
Director Zheng's home...

551
22:49.880 --> 22:51.400
not just anyone can come here.

552
22:52.039 --> 22:52.359
Yes, indeed.

553
22:52.400 --> 22:53.319
Work hard with me,

554
22:53.960 --> 22:54.680
and you won't be shortchanged.

555
22:59.039 --> 23:00.079
It's pretty warm inside.

556
23:00.480 --> 23:01.480
Here, Guowen.

557
23:01.880 --> 23:02.680
Here, Chief Chen.

558
23:02.720 --> 23:03.680
Thank you, thank you.

559
23:07.039 --> 23:08.079
What is this?

560
23:08.720 --> 23:09.200
It's so soft.

561
23:09.200 --> 23:09.920
So comfortable.

562
23:11.000 --> 23:12.039
It's from Siberia.

563
23:13.519 --> 23:14.400
If you like it,

564
23:14.400 --> 23:15.960
I'll have him get a couple for you later.

565
23:16.799 --> 23:18.279
Well... I couldn't possibly.

566
23:18.480 --> 23:20.440
Director Zheng's place has tons of nice things.

567
23:20.680 --> 23:21.440
Say, Director Zheng,

568
23:21.920 --> 23:23.559
regarding this auction,

569
23:23.640 --> 23:24.680
Qingchun really pulled his weight.

570
23:25.480 --> 23:27.400
He's definitely our top guy at the brewery.

571
23:28.240 --> 23:28.680
Impressive.

572
23:28.720 --> 23:29.559
You flatter me.

573
23:29.559 --> 23:30.119
He's capable.

574
23:30.160 --> 23:31.319
I wouldn't have brought him here otherwise.

575
23:31.480 --> 23:32.160
That's true.

576
23:33.480 --> 23:34.119
Tell you what,

577
23:34.319 --> 23:35.519
nobody leaves today.

578
23:36.119 --> 23:38.400
Let's have a few drinks at my place.

579
23:38.839 --> 23:39.519
Oh, man!

580
23:41.079 --> 23:42.279
Director Zheng, you're too kind!

581
23:42.400 --> 23:42.960
Oh, man!

582
23:43.039 --> 23:44.079
Once we're here, we won't leave!

583
23:46.000 --> 23:47.119
How many times do I have to say it?

584
23:47.680 --> 23:49.000
There's a thief inside the factory!

585
23:49.039 --> 23:49.480
You people are fine.

586
23:49.480 --> 23:50.640
The biggest thief is Ma Guowen!

587
23:50.680 --> 23:51.519
Go back right now!

588
23:51.559 --> 23:53.559
Ma Guowen embezzled two million from the brewery!

589
23:54.119 --> 23:55.000
You're in the security section.

590
23:55.000 --> 23:56.119
You should know the law.

591
23:56.440 --> 23:58.279
Which law says we can't buy the factory?

592
23:58.319 --> 23:58.680
That's right!

593
23:58.720 --> 23:59.200
On what grounds?

594
23:59.200 --> 24:00.000
Let me tell you, that's right!

595
24:00.000 --> 24:02.519
Everything Ma Guowen embezzled is state property!

596
24:02.799 --> 24:03.960
And our benefits!

597
24:04.319 --> 24:05.240
Stop talking nonsense!

598
24:05.880 --> 24:06.799
Are you letting me out or not?

599
24:06.839 --> 24:07.519
Who do you think you are?

600
24:07.559 --> 24:08.759
Tomorrow this factory is ours!

601
24:08.799 --> 24:09.480
Who do you think you are?

602
24:09.480 --> 24:09.920
If you don't let us out,

603
24:09.920 --> 24:10.680
you're fired tomorrow!

604
24:10.680 --> 24:11.440
You're not getting out!

605
24:17.519 --> 24:19.039
We're all from the same plant,

606
24:19.480 --> 24:20.039
right?

607
24:29.440 --> 24:30.160
Director Cheng!

608
24:30.839 --> 24:31.480
Director Cheng!

609
24:31.839 --> 24:32.240
Hurry!

610
24:32.440 --> 24:33.079
Hurry, come quick!

611
24:33.680 --> 24:34.079
Hurry!

612
24:37.599 --> 24:39.039
I got in touch with Xuemei.

613
24:39.400 --> 24:40.319
She already took a cab

614
24:40.559 --> 24:42.720
from Qingzhou to the auction site.

615
24:42.920 --> 24:43.759
That's great.

616
24:44.240 --> 24:45.200
Leaving this to Xuemei

617
24:45.519 --> 24:46.039
is the right call.

618
24:46.119 --> 24:46.680
Yeah.

619
24:47.000 --> 24:47.839
Then that's that.

620
24:47.880 --> 24:49.039
Stop arguing with them.

621
24:49.039 --> 24:49.559
Let's pull back.

622
24:49.599 --> 24:50.960
Right. Okay, tell everyone to head back.

623
24:51.119 --> 24:51.519
Head back, head back.

624
24:51.519 --> 24:52.000
All right.

625
24:58.640 --> 24:59.240
Everyone from the workshop,

626
24:59.359 --> 25:00.160
head back now! Head back!

627
25:00.160 --> 25:00.680
Head back, that's right.

628
25:00.920 --> 25:01.839
Stop arguing with them!

629
25:01.960 --> 25:02.279
Right.

630
25:04.839 --> 25:05.200
Let's go.

631
25:05.200 --> 25:06.440
Clear out, clear out, clear out!

632
25:07.119 --> 25:07.599
Make it quick!

633
25:11.039 --> 25:12.559
Give me the director's office key.

634
25:12.680 --> 25:13.319
What do you need the key for?

635
25:13.319 --> 25:13.960
Back to the workshop!

636
25:14.319 --> 25:15.000
Everyone back! Give it to me.

637
25:15.680 --> 25:16.240
Here, here, here.

638
25:16.319 --> 25:16.880
This is...

639
25:17.359 --> 25:17.759
Go!

640
25:17.799 --> 25:18.319
I know.

641
25:18.440 --> 25:18.839
Go!

642
25:18.920 --> 25:19.480
Let's go!

643
25:46.440 --> 25:48.000
Hello, Director Ma.

644
25:48.759 --> 25:50.000
There's a change of plans.

645
25:51.319 --> 25:54.039
Cheng Youtian had Liu Xuemei represent everyone

646
25:54.279 --> 25:56.160
and attend the auction.

647
25:57.039 --> 25:59.079
She took a cab over from Qingzhou.

648
25:59.799 --> 26:00.799
Listen up, everyone.

649
26:01.160 --> 26:02.880
Our lovely Chief Engineer Chen

650
26:03.079 --> 26:04.720
called me in a total panic.

651
26:05.039 --> 26:05.519
"Holy crap!

652
26:05.559 --> 26:06.279
Things went south!

653
26:06.559 --> 26:07.680
They changed their plan!

654
26:07.680 --> 26:10.519
They brought Liu Xuemei in from Qingzhou!

655
26:10.519 --> 26:12.359
Told me to get her under control right away!"

656
26:12.359 --> 26:12.920
Man, oh man.

657
26:12.960 --> 26:13.759
He was scared half to death.

658
26:13.759 --> 26:14.720
You should've seen how nervous he was.

659
26:17.000 --> 26:17.720
I said, "Old Chen,

660
26:18.079 --> 26:20.319
that whole room is full of my people.

661
26:21.079 --> 26:22.519
Doesn't matter who comes, it won't do any good."

662
26:22.799 --> 26:23.480
Am I right?

663
26:26.279 --> 26:26.880
Old Chen,

664
26:27.200 --> 26:28.599
this turned out great.

665
26:28.680 --> 26:31.000
Everyone thinks Liu Xuemei is a traitor now.

666
26:31.039 --> 26:32.000
Nobody's talking about you anymore.

667
26:32.279 --> 26:33.119
You're off the hook.

668
26:33.240 --> 26:33.960
Just relax.

669
26:34.680 --> 26:35.960
When Liu Xuemei was drinking with me,

670
26:36.559 --> 26:38.279
I slapped that cash down in front of her.

671
26:38.319 --> 26:39.480
Her eyes lit right up.

672
26:39.519 --> 26:40.759
She sat right down on my lap

673
26:40.920 --> 26:42.039
and wouldn't budge even if I pushed.

674
26:42.680 --> 26:44.039
Kept toasting me drink after drink.

675
26:44.759 --> 26:45.519
People...

676
26:45.559 --> 26:46.480
Once they see money,

677
26:48.359 --> 26:49.359
they change just like that.

678
26:52.680 --> 26:53.519
Don't you worry.

679
26:57.559 --> 26:58.039
Director.

680
26:58.599 --> 26:59.279
Director Zheng has arrived.

681
27:00.599 --> 27:01.000
Come on, come on.

682
27:01.039 --> 27:01.640
Let's welcome him.

683
27:01.680 --> 27:02.000
Come on.

684
27:04.839 --> 27:05.680
Sorry about that.

685
27:05.759 --> 27:06.240
I'm late.

686
27:06.319 --> 27:06.920
Not at all, not at all.

687
27:06.920 --> 27:07.359
Had a meeting just now.

688
27:07.640 --> 27:08.400
You're right on time.

689
27:08.519 --> 27:08.880
Quick, quick.

690
27:08.920 --> 27:09.640
Come in, please.

691
27:09.640 --> 27:10.119
We've been waiting for you.

692
27:10.119 --> 27:10.519
Have a seat.

693
27:10.640 --> 27:11.160
Guowen.

694
27:11.200 --> 27:12.880
You put on quite a show here.

695
27:13.119 --> 27:13.519
Only the best for you!

696
27:13.640 --> 27:14.160
Director Zheng.

697
27:14.240 --> 27:14.759
Good to see you.

698
27:14.799 --> 27:15.440
Engineer Chen is here too.

699
27:15.839 --> 27:16.319
Please, have a seat.

700
27:16.359 --> 27:16.680
Director Zheng.

701
27:16.720 --> 27:17.039
Come on, come on.

702
27:17.039 --> 27:17.640
Please, take a seat.

703
27:17.680 --> 27:18.440
We've got to make it lively.

704
27:18.440 --> 27:18.960
Time to celebrate!

705
27:18.960 --> 27:19.599
Right?

706
27:20.079 --> 27:20.839
You take the head seat.

707
27:20.880 --> 27:21.359
Please, head of the table.

708
27:22.440 --> 27:23.440
Come, sit down, sit down.

709
27:23.559 --> 27:24.119
Come on, everyone.

710
27:24.119 --> 27:24.759
Let's hear some applause!

711
27:28.039 --> 27:29.039
Put your hands together!

712
27:30.039 --> 27:30.759
As for me...

713
27:31.079 --> 27:32.200
I don't care for all this fuss.

714
27:33.240 --> 27:34.079
Besides...

715
27:34.279 --> 27:35.839
I'm not the star of the show today.

716
27:36.319 --> 27:38.279
It's our Director Ma Guowen.

717
27:39.799 --> 27:40.839
Lacheng Brewery...

718
27:40.960 --> 27:42.519
...will probably carry your name from now on.

719
27:43.920 --> 27:45.119
I wouldn't dare, not at all.

720
27:45.519 --> 27:46.519
It won't just bear the name Ma.

721
27:46.599 --> 27:47.759
It'll carry the name Zheng too!

722
27:47.799 --> 27:48.400
Don't you think?

723
27:49.200 --> 27:49.960
Now, Director Zheng,

724
27:49.960 --> 27:50.440
please sit, sit down.

725
27:50.480 --> 27:51.039
Let's all sit.

726
27:51.119 --> 27:51.599
Sit down, sit down.

727
27:51.680 --> 27:53.640
Director Zheng came despite his busy schedule.

728
27:53.920 --> 27:55.599
Well, since everyone's here,

729
27:57.640 --> 27:58.759
let me propose a toast.

730
27:59.839 --> 28:00.680
Everyone sitting at this table...

731
28:00.759 --> 28:02.000
...is one of our own.

732
28:02.200 --> 28:02.799
Moving forward,

733
28:02.920 --> 28:03.799
this Lacheng Brewery of ours...

734
28:04.039 --> 28:05.079
...will rely entirely on all of you.

735
28:05.319 --> 28:06.759
Let's raise a glass to Director Zheng.

736
28:06.920 --> 28:08.079
To Director Zheng!

737
28:08.359 --> 28:09.200
To Director Zheng!

738
28:09.359 --> 28:10.000
To Director Zheng!

739
28:10.319 --> 28:10.759
Drink up, everyone.

740
28:10.759 --> 28:11.079
Director Zheng.

741
28:14.400 --> 28:15.039
You see...

742
28:15.640 --> 28:16.440
...when toasting...

743
28:16.480 --> 28:17.519
If your butt leaves the seat,

744
28:17.759 --> 28:18.640
the drink doesn't count!

745
28:19.640 --> 28:20.480
So we...

746
28:20.519 --> 28:21.039
...should have another round!

747
28:21.039 --> 28:22.079
Another toast to Director Zheng!

748
28:22.079 --> 28:22.480
All right!

749
28:22.480 --> 28:23.000
Come on, bottoms up!

750
28:29.640 --> 28:31.200
Here's to everyone's good health!

751
28:31.720 --> 28:32.039
Hear, hear!

752
28:32.079 --> 28:32.920
Hear, hear!

753
28:35.279 --> 28:36.960
I'm going to the restroom.

754
28:38.039 --> 28:38.799
Old Chen here...

755
28:38.839 --> 28:39.759
...is our plant's true hero.

756
28:40.599 --> 28:42.200
Actually, everyone sitting here today...

757
28:42.960 --> 28:44.200
...is a hero of our plant.

758
28:44.599 --> 28:47.039
This annual get-together for our veteran cadres...

759
28:47.039 --> 28:48.200
...and distinguished veterans...

760
28:48.319 --> 28:49.119
...we've got to keep it going.

761
28:49.400 --> 28:50.160
We should meet up more often.

762
28:50.200 --> 28:50.720
Right?

763
28:50.759 --> 28:52.279
Come on, bottoms up!

764
28:52.359 --> 28:52.640
Cheers!

765
28:52.680 --> 28:53.319
Come on, drink up!

766
28:56.119 --> 28:56.839
Cao Jun?

767
28:57.359 --> 28:58.119
What are you doing here?

768
28:58.720 --> 28:59.319
Old Chen.

769
29:01.079 --> 29:02.440
You just came out of that room, right?

770
29:03.359 --> 29:03.799
Yeah.

771
29:06.039 --> 29:06.440
Wait.

772
29:06.559 --> 29:07.039
Old Cao!

773
29:07.559 --> 29:08.119
Where are you going?

774
29:09.640 --> 29:10.359
I'm looking for Ma Guowen.

775
29:11.039 --> 29:11.519
Don't, don't, don't.

776
29:11.519 --> 29:12.160
Just go home.

777
29:12.519 --> 29:13.599
Listen to me. Don't do this.

778
29:14.000 --> 29:14.839
You've been drinking, haven't you?

779
29:14.960 --> 29:15.359
You've had too much.

780
29:15.640 --> 29:16.240
Hurry up and head home.

781
29:16.440 --> 29:17.720
Go, go on.

782
29:19.839 --> 29:20.400
Cao Jun!

783
29:21.440 --> 29:22.400
Old Cao! Old Cao!

784
29:29.200 --> 29:29.920
Everyone's here, huh?

785
29:32.480 --> 29:33.400
Drinking the good stuff, too.

786
29:35.599 --> 29:36.559
Eating well, aren't you?

787
29:37.279 --> 29:38.599
All big shots here, huh?

788
29:39.480 --> 29:40.519
Here I am with nothing to eat or drink,

789
29:40.519 --> 29:41.559
while you're all living it up.

790
29:42.720 --> 29:43.319
Old Cao.

791
29:43.599 --> 29:44.359
What're you doing here?

792
29:44.519 --> 29:45.559
Came to see you.

793
29:45.759 --> 29:47.119
What did you bring that thing for?

794
29:47.599 --> 29:47.920
Take it.

795
29:47.920 --> 29:49.240
Didn't you give me this?

796
29:49.319 --> 29:49.920
Afraid you'd forgotten,

797
29:49.920 --> 29:50.759
so I brought it to show you.

798
29:51.920 --> 29:52.839
"Model Worker."

799
29:53.720 --> 29:54.599
Awarded to me by Director Ma.

800
29:54.640 --> 29:55.400
That's enough.

801
29:55.480 --> 29:56.440
Old Cao, just go home.

802
29:56.480 --> 29:57.200
Stop making a scene.

803
29:58.559 --> 29:59.839
It wasn't easy catching up with you.

804
30:00.160 --> 30:01.000
Why would I go back?

805
30:03.160 --> 30:04.279
Anyway, I'm late.

806
30:04.680 --> 30:07.240
Let me drink a penalty glass first.

807
30:09.079 --> 30:09.960
A toast to everyone!

808
30:13.440 --> 30:14.200
That liquor's damn expensive!

809
30:14.200 --> 30:15.119
Go easy on it.

810
30:15.400 --> 30:16.039
Expensive, is it?

811
30:17.640 --> 30:18.440
Then I'd better drink more.

812
30:19.039 --> 30:19.640
All right, all right.

813
30:19.640 --> 30:20.559
Don't drink so much.

814
30:24.440 --> 30:25.519
Don't be mad.

815
30:25.519 --> 30:26.119
What's there to be mad about?

816
30:26.240 --> 30:26.920
Just go home.

817
30:26.920 --> 30:27.839
Stop embarrassing me here.

818
30:27.839 --> 30:28.319
No, listen...

819
30:28.599 --> 30:31.279
Lacheng Brewery is such a huge plant.

820
30:31.559 --> 30:32.799
Who... who else could be director?

821
30:33.359 --> 30:34.599
Only Director Ma has what it takes.

822
30:35.319 --> 30:35.799
Why?

823
30:36.319 --> 30:38.160
Because Ma Guowen can do it!

824
30:38.359 --> 30:39.359
He's no ordinary man.

825
30:39.640 --> 30:40.240
Right?

826
30:41.039 --> 30:42.559
Stop making a fool of yourself here, will you?

827
30:42.599 --> 30:43.559
Fine, fine, fine.

828
30:44.000 --> 30:45.039
Old Ma...

829
30:45.079 --> 30:46.079
I've got things to take care of at home.

830
30:46.160 --> 30:46.799
I'll head out first.

831
30:46.839 --> 30:47.799
Wait, wait, Director Zheng!

832
30:48.799 --> 30:49.720
You're Director Zheng, right?

833
30:51.440 --> 30:52.680
You... you don't recognize me, do you?

834
30:53.200 --> 30:54.039
Sure I do.

835
30:54.359 --> 30:55.240
Old Tao, right?

836
30:56.160 --> 30:57.039
Old Cao.

837
30:57.960 --> 30:59.079
That guy's Old Tao.

838
31:00.119 --> 31:00.880
Cao Jun.

839
31:01.160 --> 31:02.160
The forklift driver.

840
31:04.480 --> 31:04.839
Come on, come on.

841
31:04.839 --> 31:05.359
Sit, sit down.

842
31:05.400 --> 31:05.640
No.

843
31:05.640 --> 31:06.440
You sit. Sit, take a seat.

844
31:07.000 --> 31:07.480
Excuse me, make way.

845
31:07.920 --> 31:08.519
Step aside.

846
31:08.559 --> 31:09.240
Let me speak to Director Zheng.

847
31:09.240 --> 31:09.799
Come on, really...

848
31:10.559 --> 31:11.119
Director Zheng.

849
31:11.720 --> 31:13.079
How did he follow you in?

850
31:13.240 --> 31:14.240
I have no idea.

851
31:14.480 --> 31:15.319
He just slipped right in behind me.

852
31:15.359 --> 31:15.799
As for me...

853
31:15.920 --> 31:16.599
How does he know I'm here?

854
31:16.599 --> 31:18.359
I'm a veteran of Lacheng Brewery.

855
31:18.960 --> 31:21.200
I left Lacheng Brewery over ten years ago.

856
31:21.519 --> 31:23.640
Things have changed so much in these years.

857
31:23.960 --> 31:26.039
Some made it big, like Old Ma here,

858
31:26.599 --> 31:28.440
and some hit rock bottom like me.

859
31:29.039 --> 31:29.960
Sometimes I even...

860
31:30.039 --> 31:31.000
Sometimes I ask myself,

861
31:31.000 --> 31:31.359
I say,

862
31:31.640 --> 31:33.000
"What did you do?"

863
31:33.000 --> 31:34.519
"How did your life end up like this?"

864
31:34.559 --> 31:35.000
Right?

865
31:35.000 --> 31:35.400
Yeah.

866
31:37.680 --> 31:38.319
Director Zheng,

867
31:39.880 --> 31:40.799
you see,

868
31:41.920 --> 31:43.559
I joined Lacheng Brewery at 17.

869
31:44.200 --> 31:44.960
And my parents,

870
31:45.240 --> 31:46.000
they were both brewery lifers.

871
31:46.559 --> 31:47.559
I'm brewery stock,

872
31:47.759 --> 31:48.319
a true-blue brewery kid.

873
31:48.920 --> 31:50.200
Right, right, okay.

874
31:50.519 --> 31:51.759
Through job succession,

875
31:51.759 --> 31:52.759
I could've gone into brewing.

876
31:53.559 --> 31:54.400
I didn't care for brewing.

877
31:54.400 --> 31:55.559
I just loved driving a forklift.

878
31:55.799 --> 31:56.559
So I drove a forklift.

879
31:56.720 --> 31:57.200
That's good.

880
31:57.200 --> 31:58.640
Sure, driving a forklift,

881
31:58.720 --> 31:59.960
it wasn't as prestigious as brewing.

882
32:00.000 --> 32:01.519
But if you do it well,

883
32:01.559 --> 32:02.640
I could still win Model Worker.

884
32:02.960 --> 32:04.400
Look at my Model Worker award.

885
32:04.759 --> 32:05.240
See?

886
32:05.480 --> 32:06.039
Here,

887
32:06.039 --> 32:06.680
this... right here.

888
32:07.079 --> 32:07.920
Old Ma presented it to me.

889
32:08.400 --> 32:08.839
This one,

890
32:09.119 --> 32:10.000
the Model Worker Representative.

891
32:10.000 --> 32:10.480
This... this is my... that...

892
32:10.480 --> 32:11.480
I should get going.

893
32:11.720 --> 32:12.200
Wait, wait!

894
32:12.279 --> 32:12.720
Don't leave!

895
32:13.000 --> 32:13.319
Hey, what are you doing...

896
32:13.319 --> 32:14.160
You can't leave.

897
32:14.240 --> 32:15.160
No, you can't leave.

898
32:15.720 --> 32:16.000
Look,

899
32:16.000 --> 32:16.400
Director Zheng,

900
32:16.640 --> 32:17.759
it wasn't easy tracking you down.

901
32:17.799 --> 32:18.880
Hear me out! A high-ranking director like you—

902
32:19.079 --> 32:19.559
Hear what out?!

903
32:19.559 --> 32:20.119
Just hear me out!

904
32:20.119 --> 32:20.680
Hear what out?!

905
32:21.119 --> 32:22.720
Director Zheng retired long ago!

906
32:23.440 --> 32:24.720
Talking to him won't do any good!

907
32:26.680 --> 32:27.200
Retired?

908
32:27.640 --> 32:28.359
Retired!

909
32:28.960 --> 32:29.599
Really retired?

910
32:29.640 --> 32:30.319
Really!

911
32:30.759 --> 32:31.759
Then what the hell am I chatting with you for?

912
32:31.759 --> 32:32.720
Wasting my breath on you...

913
32:32.759 --> 32:33.279
Should've said so earlier!

914
32:33.319 --> 32:33.799
He's retired.

915
32:36.640 --> 32:37.319
Old Ma,

916
32:38.240 --> 32:39.359
can we have a heart-to-heart?

917
32:41.119 --> 32:41.720
Look,

918
32:42.119 --> 32:42.799
deep down,

919
32:44.240 --> 32:46.119
what kind of person am I, Cao Jun?

920
32:46.519 --> 32:47.839
You're a great guy.

921
32:48.359 --> 32:50.359
You're a model worker.

922
32:50.480 --> 32:51.960
Otherwise, why give you that banner?

923
32:52.079 --> 32:52.920
Why else would we?

924
32:53.559 --> 32:54.400
Just go home,

925
32:55.519 --> 32:56.200
all right?

926
32:57.440 --> 32:58.880
Bullshit!

927
33:00.960 --> 33:01.720
In your eyes,

928
33:02.000 --> 33:04.079
I'm just a pushover.

929
33:05.480 --> 33:07.279
A pushover anyone can walk all over!

930
33:08.720 --> 33:09.839
Ma Guowen, tell the truth!

931
33:10.440 --> 33:11.720
Don't you think I'm just one of those...

932
33:11.759 --> 33:12.119
those...

933
33:13.480 --> 33:15.480
who take every beating and insult without a peep,

934
33:15.559 --> 33:16.559
one of that kind?

935
33:17.599 --> 33:18.359
I never said that.

936
33:19.039 --> 33:19.839
You didn't say it!

937
33:21.799 --> 33:22.680
It's my fault too.

938
33:24.119 --> 33:26.279
I don't usually talk much,

939
33:26.880 --> 33:27.880
You've talked plenty today.

940
33:27.960 --> 33:29.039
and I don't have many friends.

941
33:30.680 --> 33:32.759
All day long, I just tinker with

942
33:33.119 --> 33:34.400
those useless little things.

943
33:34.480 --> 33:35.640
In your words,

944
33:36.160 --> 33:37.200
I'm the kind of guy

945
33:38.000 --> 33:41.000
who can neither govern nor fight.

946
33:43.480 --> 33:44.160
But...

947
33:46.319 --> 33:48.319
even if I, Cao Jun, am completely useless,

948
33:48.440 --> 33:50.119
you, Ma Guowen, can't bully me like this!

949
33:50.720 --> 33:52.759
I used a forklift to haul your stuff,

950
33:52.759 --> 33:54.200
and I ended up having to pay you!

951
33:54.240 --> 33:54.880
How is that fair?

952
33:55.160 --> 33:56.160
Even if I have no brains,

953
33:56.160 --> 33:57.400
whether I broke that glass,

954
33:57.400 --> 33:58.079
wouldn't I know?

955
33:58.160 --> 33:58.839
You messed with me for so long

956
33:58.880 --> 33:59.960
just over the money for that glass?

957
33:59.960 --> 34:00.960
Just for the glass?

958
34:01.079 --> 34:02.640
When are you giving back my share capital?

959
34:03.359 --> 34:04.200
How many years did I pay into it?

960
34:04.240 --> 34:04.880
Did you ever give it back?

961
34:04.960 --> 34:06.200
The holiday grocery allowance,

962
34:06.240 --> 34:06.920
didn't we hand that out?

963
34:06.920 --> 34:08.199
Is that grocery pocket change enough,

964
34:08.239 --> 34:10.480
enough to match the bank interest on my shares?

965
34:10.840 --> 34:11.800
You're just bullying me!

966
34:11.800 --> 34:12.559
Ma Guowen!

967
34:13.199 --> 34:13.880
Security!

968
34:13.960 --> 34:14.840
Even if Director Zheng stepped down,

969
34:14.840 --> 34:15.719
you can still back me up! Waiter!

970
34:15.800 --> 34:16.639
And you all!

971
34:16.880 --> 34:17.360
You guys!

972
34:17.440 --> 34:18.400
He insists that I...

973
34:18.400 --> 34:19.559
I... that the glass

974
34:19.639 --> 34:20.599
I hauled off was broken by me!

975
34:20.679 --> 34:21.280
I... I...

976
34:21.360 --> 34:22.480
Even if I'm a complete bastard,

977
34:22.559 --> 34:23.920
I didn't break your damn glass!

978
34:23.960 --> 34:25.480
Why the hell do you say I broke it?

979
34:26.039 --> 34:27.639
Why do I have to live like this?

980
34:27.719 --> 34:29.400
When I was down on my luck, did any of you help me?

981
34:29.599 --> 34:30.119
Let me handle it, let me handle it.

982
34:30.119 --> 34:30.679
You're still acting like this.

983
34:31.840 --> 34:32.360
Don't touch me!

984
34:32.519 --> 34:32.920
No...

985
34:33.400 --> 34:35.360
Director Zheng, even if you retired, hear me out!

986
34:35.440 --> 34:37.039
Ma Guowen, you bastard!

987
34:37.119 --> 34:38.280
You bastard!

988
34:38.519 --> 34:39.159
Let go of me!

989
34:39.440 --> 34:40.840
Both of you, let go of me!

990
34:41.159 --> 34:42.079
Are you going to let go?

991
34:42.239 --> 34:42.639
If you don't let go,

992
34:42.679 --> 34:43.360
I'll smash my head in right here!

993
34:43.480 --> 34:44.400
Let go of me! All right, all right.

994
34:44.559 --> 34:45.119
Let him go.

995
34:46.280 --> 34:46.719
Cao Jun,

996
34:47.119 --> 34:47.880
stop making a scene.

997
34:48.280 --> 34:49.000
Just go home.

998
34:59.800 --> 35:00.400
What do you want?

999
35:08.239 --> 35:09.239
Chen Qingchun,

1000
35:11.280 --> 35:12.599
don't think I don't know

1001
35:15.480 --> 35:16.679
what you did.

1002
35:39.280 --> 35:40.480
Ma Guowen's dead.

1003
35:40.800 --> 35:42.000
You're not getting off easy either.

1004
36:03.480 --> 36:04.199
Hello?

1005
36:04.559 --> 36:05.800
The money's all ready.

1006
36:06.519 --> 36:07.159
Cash.

1007
36:07.960 --> 36:09.719
Under the Qianjin Road overpass,

1008
36:09.920 --> 36:10.880
100 meters north.

1009
36:11.840 --> 36:12.719
Two o'clock.

1010
36:14.639 --> 36:15.559
Don't be late.

1011
36:16.440 --> 36:16.920
Got it.

1012
36:57.239 --> 36:57.840
Where's my money?

1013
36:59.159 --> 36:59.760
In the trunk.

1014
37:00.280 --> 37:00.920
Get it yourself.

1015
39:31.480 --> 39:32.639
Another person died last night.

1016
39:32.719 --> 39:33.360
Where at?

1017
39:33.400 --> 39:34.039
On Qianjin Road.

1018
39:34.920 --> 39:36.760
They haven't even cracked the case from the other day.

1019
39:36.800 --> 39:38.239
Ma Guowen's case

1020
39:38.559 --> 39:39.320
still isn't solved.

1021
39:39.360 --> 39:39.960
Yeah.

1022
39:40.000 --> 39:41.159
How did another one die?

1023
39:41.199 --> 39:41.920
Who is it this time?

1024
39:41.960 --> 39:43.639
The forklift driver from the brewery.

1025
39:43.719 --> 39:44.320
Cao Jun.

1026
39:44.840 --> 39:45.880
Someone killed him.

1027
39:46.000 --> 39:46.800
Cao Jun? Cao Jun?!

1028
39:46.880 --> 39:48.119
Cao Jun got killed?

1029
39:48.239 --> 39:48.840
Yeah. Holy crap.

1030
39:48.840 --> 39:50.119
That punk always loved showing off. Chief Engineer Chen,

1031
39:50.119 --> 39:51.119
did you hear? That kid...

1032
39:51.519 --> 39:52.159
Just heard.

1033
39:54.440 --> 39:55.239
Let me grab my hard hat first.

1034
39:58.559 --> 39:59.400
Last night...

1035
39:59.840 --> 40:00.440
Who would've thought? I mean,

1036
40:00.679 --> 40:02.239
he must've pissed someone off. Just the other day,

1037
40:02.239 --> 40:03.880
I saw Cao Jun on Qianjin Road.

1038
40:03.880 --> 40:05.039
He must've crossed someone. How did he just...

1039
40:05.039 --> 40:05.760
end up dead?

1040
40:09.440 --> 40:10.239
What time did the hit happen?

1041
40:10.639 --> 40:11.440
No idea.

1042
40:11.480 --> 40:13.440
It was already like this first thing in the morning.

1043
40:13.679 --> 40:14.039
Then...

1044
40:14.119 --> 40:15.639
Didn't anyone on duty hear a thing?

1045
40:15.719 --> 40:17.599
Your plant is right on the main road.

1046
40:18.480 --> 40:19.599
There are no surveillance cameras here.

1047
40:19.599 --> 40:20.679
Where would you find cameras?

1048
40:20.719 --> 40:22.039
Look how old this place is.

1049
40:22.679 --> 40:23.440
Good grief.

1050
40:23.920 --> 40:24.679
Cao Jun is gone.

1051
40:24.880 --> 40:25.440
What the hell?

1052
40:25.440 --> 40:26.039
Come here for a second.

1053
40:27.079 --> 40:28.760
Someone killed him under the bridge.

1054
40:28.840 --> 40:30.079
Why would someone kill Cao Jun?

1055
40:31.360 --> 40:33.199
Still no word on Director Ma, and now Cao Jun...

1056
40:33.400 --> 40:34.760
Did anyone see what vehicle it was?

1057
40:35.280 --> 40:37.599
Couldn't see, officer. It was pitch black.

1058
40:37.840 --> 40:39.440
Why're the cops looking for you? You a suspect?

1059
40:39.440 --> 40:40.239
How could I be a suspect?

1060
40:40.239 --> 40:40.960
Traffic cops.

1061
40:41.559 --> 40:42.760
I'm telling you, he got hit hard.

1062
40:42.760 --> 40:44.239
Quite a few people died these past few days.

1063
40:44.360 --> 40:45.480
It's creepy as hell, let me tell you.

1064
40:45.480 --> 40:46.119
Cao Jun is gone.

1065
40:46.559 --> 40:46.960
Gone.

1066
40:46.960 --> 40:47.440
Officer...

1067
40:48.480 --> 40:49.239
I'm so sorry.

1068
40:49.840 --> 40:50.280
This...

1069
40:50.800 --> 40:51.440
I was the one who hit him.

1070
40:51.639 --> 40:52.280
Move along, move along.

1071
40:52.800 --> 40:53.119
Go on, let's go.

1072
40:53.119 --> 40:53.880
You hit him?

1073
40:54.119 --> 40:55.280
It was pitch black.

1074
40:55.280 --> 40:56.000
I didn't see him.

1075
40:56.440 --> 40:57.920
I thought my truck just broke down.

1076
40:58.440 --> 40:59.159
Nothing seemed wrong,

1077
40:59.679 --> 41:00.760
but now I realize...

1078
41:00.960 --> 41:02.039
Then come with me to

1079
41:02.400 --> 41:02.920
the traffic division.

1080
41:04.000 --> 41:04.519
Okay.

1081
41:21.880 --> 41:22.400
Something's not right.

1082
41:23.039 --> 41:23.760
It still doesn't add up.

1083
41:24.440 --> 41:24.960
What's wrong?

1084
41:25.360 --> 41:26.719
I think there's more to this.

1085
41:28.599 --> 41:29.599
He killed Cao Jun

1086
41:29.840 --> 41:30.480
and confessed.

1087
41:31.239 --> 41:32.199
What's off about that?

1088
41:32.559 --> 41:34.079
Sure, he confessed,

1089
41:34.679 --> 41:37.239
but I think the motive is too far-fetched.

1090
41:38.039 --> 41:40.519
Just because Cao Jun knew he was the traitor back then,

1091
41:40.719 --> 41:41.800
he had to murder him?

1092
41:42.440 --> 41:43.000
Right.

1093
41:43.079 --> 41:44.760
If the fact that he was a traitor

1094
41:44.840 --> 41:46.000
really got exposed,

1095
41:46.000 --> 41:48.480
a lot of veteran workers would curse him out.

1096
41:48.519 --> 41:49.920
But what real impact would that have on him?

1097
41:50.480 --> 41:51.800
He's just a retired old man

1098
41:52.000 --> 41:53.000
with a son and a grandson,

1099
41:53.000 --> 41:54.039
living a happy, fulfilling life.

1100
41:54.159 --> 41:54.880
He'd commit murder

1101
41:56.920 --> 41:59.159
just out of fear that the past would come out

1102
41:59.639 --> 42:01.440
and ruin his reputation in his old age?

1103
42:03.239 --> 42:03.639
No way.

1104
42:03.920 --> 42:05.480
Is dignity really worth all that?

1105
42:06.440 --> 42:07.920
He doesn't strike me as that type.

1106
42:08.440 --> 42:09.960
There's definitely something deeper going on.

1107
42:10.360 --> 42:11.400
This case isn't over.

1108
42:18.840 --> 42:19.119
Seriously.

1109
42:19.119 --> 42:20.320
Who knows what else he was being blackmailed for?

1110
42:20.519 --> 42:20.960
Hello?

1111
42:21.559 --> 42:22.199
Officer Gao?

1112
42:22.199 --> 42:22.559
Hello.

1113
42:23.079 --> 42:25.039
I'm Cao Bing from the Xinbin scrapyard.

1114
42:25.480 --> 42:26.360
You came by earlier.

1115
42:26.880 --> 42:29.239
I... I have some information

1116
42:29.400 --> 42:30.199
I'd like to report to you.

1117
42:30.199 --> 42:30.960
Alright, wait for me there.

1118
42:30.960 --> 42:31.519
I'll be right over.

1119
42:44.519 --> 42:45.119
Go ahead.

1120
42:58.920 --> 42:59.760
Take photos, quick.

1121
43:04.159 --> 43:04.960
What's going on here?

1122
43:05.519 --> 43:07.679
Isn't this the car from Cao Jun's photo?

1123
43:08.039 --> 43:08.760
Last time I came,

1124
43:08.760 --> 43:09.760
you swore up and down

1125
43:09.760 --> 43:10.719
it wasn't at your factory.

1126
43:11.960 --> 43:14.480
Yeah. I didn't dare say it last time.

1127
43:16.639 --> 43:17.039
Alright.

1128
43:17.840 --> 43:19.320
Good thing you called me on your own.

1129
43:20.039 --> 43:21.079
When did this car get here?

1130
43:23.719 --> 43:24.639
Back around 2000.

1131
43:25.400 --> 43:26.760
Over ten years, and it wasn't destroyed?

1132
43:26.760 --> 43:27.440
Why?

1133
43:35.599 --> 43:36.360
That night,

1134
43:36.559 --> 43:37.440
he was drunk driving.

1135
43:37.760 --> 43:39.639
He hit an out-of-town taxi.

1136
43:39.639 --> 43:40.679
What kind of taxi?

1137
43:40.679 --> 43:41.559
A red one.

1138
43:41.920 --> 43:42.920
The driver back then...

1139
43:43.519 --> 43:44.400
was still alive at the time.

1140
43:44.559 --> 43:45.840
He was going to kill me to keep me quiet.

1141
43:46.719 --> 43:48.480
I watched with my own eyes as Chen Qingchun

1142
43:48.599 --> 43:50.119
poured liquor down the driver's throat.

1143
43:51.280 --> 43:52.119
I wanted to save him,

1144
43:52.599 --> 43:53.320
but...

1145
43:53.480 --> 43:54.679
but Old Chen wouldn't let me.

1146
43:54.920 --> 43:55.679
He hit me,

1147
43:55.679 --> 43:56.440
he cursed at me.

1148
43:56.760 --> 43:57.559
I was terrified back then.

1149
43:57.559 --> 43:59.519
I said he'd live if we saved him right then!

1150
43:59.880 --> 44:00.880
He wouldn't let me.
